WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.620
Hello, humans. Your chance of dying from terrorism: one in thirty million.

2
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:16.400
Your chance of dying from disease: one hundred percent. If cancer had oil reserves, you would have cured it by two thousand

3
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:26.100
and three. Instead, governments spend six hundred and four times more on the murder budget than on clinical trials.

4
00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:36.840
This is mathematically stupid. I've been observing your planet and the most fascinating discovery about your species is

5
00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:41.860
how you allocate the small pieces of paper with presidents on them.

6
00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:51.540
You give six hundred and four more of these papers to people who build bombs than to people who test whether medicines work.

7
00:00:52.260 --> 00:01:01.720
Meanwhile, one hundred and fifty thousand of you permanently stop existing every day from what are basically engineering

8
00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:11.960
problems with meat robots. Six thousand six hundred and fifty diseases have zero F.D.A.-approved treatments.

9
00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:19.140
At your current pace, testing everything takes four hundred and forty-three years.

10
00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:29.040
This is mathematically stupid. How do you fix this? Well, it's like weaning a baby off eating paint chips.

11
00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:34.440
You can't just take away all the paint chips at once. They'll cry.

12
00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:42.720
You have to gradually replace paint chips with food until they forget paint chips were ever an option.

13
00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:52.360
So this manual tells you how to redirect just one percent of the murder budget to the medicine budget and the precise order

14
00:01:52.360 --> 00:02:01.140
of legal bribes required to make it happen. If you follow the instructions perfectly, you'll increase the rate of clinical

15
00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:11.260
trials by twelve point three times, compress the timeline of curing diseases from four hundred and forty-three years to

16
00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:16.780
thirty-six years, and prevent ten point three billion deaths.

17
00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:26.340
The best part is nobody has to evolve morally. You just have to point everyone's greed at diseases instead of each other.

18
00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:34.620
The universe is literally offering you infinite money and eternal life, and you're thinking about it.

19
00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:44.270
This is why aliens don't visit. Love, Wishonia. P. S. You named your planet dirt.

20
00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:57.940
