21
00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:08.240
Podcasts, or any podcast app. Take fifteen seconds to tell us what fraction of humanity's resources should go to explosions

22
00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:18.360
versus clinical trials. If the treaty passes, your vote will be personally to blame for saving thirty-eight point four lives

23
00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:29.560
and preventing six point nine million hours of suffering. War On Disease dot org Translated from the original Wishonian

24
